{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FJdfWDs9lLOQL9wvsAT7WQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:51.370038+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FJdfWDs9lLOQL9wvsAT7WQ","html":"<div><p><span><span>为了促进全国各高校物理学、核科学与技术、电子科学与技术、材料工程及相关学科优秀大学生的互动与交流，培养大学生从事科学研究的兴趣，并为优秀本科生提供了解我院学术科研环境和与专家、学者交流的机会。我院将于</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span>日至</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span>日在成都（四川大学望江校区）举办“物理学院</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span>。夏令营期间将进行一系列活动，如学院宣传及学科介绍、专家讲坛、营员与导师交流、参观校史馆等活动。现面向全国高校招收营员</span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span>名左右，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></span></p><p><b><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、全国各高校物理学、核科学与技术、电子科学与技术、材料工程以及相关的交叉学科的三年级本科生（</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>届毕业生）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、本科期间品学兼优，无违纪记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、对从事物理学、核科学与技术、电子科学与技术、材料工程等的学术研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>、英语达到国家四</span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span>六级水平（</span></span><span><span><span>425</span></span></span><span><span>分以上）或</span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span><span>GRE</span></span></span><span><span>等考试成绩优秀者。</span></span></p><p><b><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、申请表（报名成功后由系统自动生成，下载后经所在单位推荐盖章后再上传至系统）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、本科成绩单和专业排名证明（各</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>份，需加盖所在学校教务处公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件等。</span></span></p><p><b><span><span>三、申请办法及时间</span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、报名方法：</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（</span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly</span></span></span><span><span>）进行报名，并将申请表、本科成绩单、专业排名证明、相关获奖证书复印件、学术成果复印件的电子文档按顺序合成一个</span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span>文件并以“夏令营</span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span>本科学校全称</span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span>学生姓名”命名后上传报名系统，本次活动不接受纸质材料，上传系统的电子版材料需签章齐全</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注意：第一次报名成功之后生成申请表，签章完成后和其他附件合成一个</span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span>文档并按要求命名，然后再点击“上传（更新）附件”就可以重新提交包含申请表的附件。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、报名时间：</span></span></p><p><span><span>自即日起开始报名，截止日期为</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span>日上午</span></span><span><span><span>10:00</span></span></span><span><span>，过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、审核录取</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营的材料审核与营员录取工作预计在</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span>日结束，请于</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span>日前后自行登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（</span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly</span></span></span><span><span>）查询，系统中未查询到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。如果录取，请及时在系统中确认是否同意参加。</span></span></p><p><b><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></b></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>、在营期间进行的一切相关活动，禁止录音录像。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>、在营期间，营员必须遵守四川大学的相关规定，且做好自身的安全防护工作。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>、线下营员前来参加夏令营活动，需告知所在学校和父母，在征得同意后注意出行安全。对因违反四川大学相关规定和营员手册等规章制度导致的安全事故，由本人承担所有责任。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span>、营员报到时需携带身份证、学生证，报名时请考虑好自己的时间安排，被录取为营员后无特殊情况不得随意放弃。如遇不可抗因素不能参加，请第一时间与我院沟通，一旦报到，无特殊情况须全程参加夏令营。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>、申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若在任何阶段发现申请材料不真实、不准确，或有弄虚作假、违纪作弊等行为的，即取消申请人一切资格，一切后果自负。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>、夏令营开营期间，外校营员的午餐由我院统一安排；往返交通费及住宿费由营员自理。</span></span></p><p><b><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></b></p><p><span><span>联系人：苏老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span><span>028-85415561</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年川大物院优秀大学生夏令营</span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span>群：</span></span><span><span><span>162624839</span></span></span><span><span>。请以“姓名</span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span>所在学校”进行实名验证入群。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>四川大学物理学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>22</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"be80cf89597be669629905d6ec0735ea3834158f1e129dc02f14939b3a293ebe","textLength":1426,"sourceSha256":"b6ac8823cf07a4e6f0d9b695169bae8ece4ce581315208e41202805338c17e5a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-83073f6e57e0d76eed08","title":"2026年四川大学物理学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:51.370038+00:00"}
